					<div id="sub-main-contents" class="sub-main-contents clearfix">
						

																								<div id="contents-3306" class="contents-wrapper" title="모집요강">
							<h3>대학원</h3>
<p class="btn-wrap2"><a href="https://jejunu.ac.kr/cs/download.htm?act=download&amp;seq=249846&amp;no=1" target="_blank" title="새창" class="btn2">원서접수방법</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.uwayapply.com" target="_blank" title="새창" class="btn2">원서접수</a></p>
<h4>2027학년도 대학원&nbsp;재외국인 및 외국인&nbsp;특별전형 모집요강</h4>
<div class="contents-table">
<table>
<thead> 
<tr>
<th>한국어</th>
<th>영어</th>
<th>서식</th>
</tr> 
</thead>
